          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Did you know sitting can hurt you?"
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "Sitting is hard for your shoulders and back."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "You might feel pain."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "Your blood moves slow, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "Your heart has to work harder."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "The blood doesn’t move easily."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "This can hurt your muscles."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "It can hurt your brain, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "So don’t sit for too long."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "Take breaks."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "Get up and move!"
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Moving makes your body happy and healthy."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
